- Coumarin: 20 uL of approximately 25–30% stock corresponds to a **5–6 uL-equivalent sensitivity range / 833.3–1,000 model ppm**; exact active mass and safety remain HOLD.
- Minimum direct formula aliquot: **10 uL**.

